# GENERATED by platform/scripts/hats-appointments-4175.py — do not hand-edit.
#
# Jeff's rule, 2026-09-14: "the owner wears all 4 for their products domains
# and services." Four appointments per owned anchor, appointee = ownedBy, so
# an appointment can never disagree with the ownership it qualifies — which is
# what gc-appointee-is-the-owner refuses. Re-run after any ownership change.
#
# 65 owned anchors (41 Domain, 12 Product, 12 Service) x 4 hats = 260 appointments.
#
# NOT APPOINTED — no chorus:ownedBy, reported rather than guessed at:
#   logs-domain-service-loki

